    "512px frame canvas, source sheets 1448x1086; standing characters roughly 275\u2013320px tall, not 1024px per-frame HD.",
    "Death terminal holds; foot/root anchor is a visual packing anchor, not a collision or skeletal root.",
    "Browser playback unverified; temporal semantics verified in code and GIF metadata."
